blocks.text:
Commit offence at the lotus feet of vaiṣṇavas by going to exaggerate the efficacy of the doctrine of action (karma vicār);

Conclude that the 'panca-rātrā system' is anti-vedic;

Harm my eternal welfare by observing objects of worship - Sankarṣaṇ, Pradyumna and Aniruddha as distinct from Vāsudeva;

Have imbibed belief in absolute monism due to my offence at the lotus feet of Śāndilya Ṛṣi.
